    "title": "Who are the Northwest Arkansas area high school alumni in action on Saturday, Nov. 22?",
    "text": "Saturday, Nov. 22 will feature competition from these former Northwest Arkansas area high school standouts.\nCole Keylon\nHarding Bison\nSenior\n6′0″ 210\nHarrison High School\nHometown: Harrison\nNext Game: vs. Northwest Missouri State Bearcats, Saturday, Nov. 22, 1 p.m.\nJonathan Schaffer\nEvangel Valors\nJunior\n6′1″ 300\nHarrison High School\nHometown: Harrison\nNext Game: vs. Saint Francis Cougars, Saturday, Nov. 22, 11 a.m.\nMatt Colvin\nHarding Bison\nSophomore\n6′2″ 325\nClarksville High School\nHometown: Clarksville\nNext Game: vs. Northwest Missouri State Bearcats, Saturday, Nov. 22, 1 p.m.\nTalan Hill\nEvangel Valors\nFreshman\n6′0″ 225\nBerryville High School\nHometown: Berryville\nNext Game: vs. Saint Francis Cougars, Saturday, Nov. 22, 11 a.m.\nTalon Stephens\nEvangel Valors\nFreshman\n5′10″ 160\nHarrison High School\nHometown: Harrison\nNext Game: vs. Saint Francis Cougars, Saturday, Nov. 22, 11 a.m.",
